 he Garden Comedy Show is bringing seven nights of stand-up comedy to the T
 oronto Fringe Festival.\nRunning nightly from July 6 - 12 at Ollie Quinn i
 n Leslieville\, this isn't the same show repeated seven times. Every night
  features an entirely different lineup of professional comedians\, making 
 each performance a unique event.\nAudiences can expect some of Canada's to
 p comics with credits including Netflix\, Just for Laughs\, CBC\, SiriusXM
 \, Crave\, and more. Whether it's your first visit or your fifth\, you'll 
