BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Photomagic 44 Summer Camp
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260706T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260706T160000
UID:blogto-232928@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/03/31/original_image4a2a7abb-53d9-4e62-88e9-59788daf89
 26.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This innovative and immersive camp focuses on photography and 
 darkroom techniques—learn to use 35mm manual cameras\, practice street p
 hotography on photo walks\, and print images with traditional darkroom pro
 cesses.\nThe five-day camp takes full advantage of Gallery 44's extensive 
 production facilities\, set within the 401 Richmond arts building\, a vibr
 ant hub home to a dynamic arts community of artist studios\, festivals and
  galleries.\nParticipants will:\nEXPLORE the city with a camera\nTRANSFORM
  an idea into a photograph\nCREATE photos with a manual 35 mm film camera 
 (provided by Gallery 44)\nPRINT black and white photographs in a tradition
 al wet darkroom\nDISCOVER contemporary art galleries in Toronto\nVENTURE o
 ut on field trips to locations such as Kensignton Market and Chinatown\nBU
 ILD lasting friendships!
LOCATION:Gallery 44 Centre for Contemporary Photography
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/photomagic-44-summer-camp-toronto-3/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
