 give you a topic you know absolutely nothing about in return. Past topics 
 include why Toronto needs more gargoyles\, normal behaviours that should b
 e punishable by law and ranking the best public bathrooms in Toronto.\nYou
 'll have 30 minutes to come up with a 3-minute Power Point on that very to
 pic. Then you'll present it in front of your new friends. All you need is 
 a laptop and a Power Point-like program you can create a slide deck on. Th
