 be special.\nWith Madonna's newly released Confessions II generating buzz 
 - and Toronto's love of the Blue Jays and baseball always in full swing - 
 we're turning the pre-show into a Madonna-inspired celebration. So whether
  you're a fan of Madge\, the Jays\, or just want a fun night out\, there's
  something for everyone:\n🎧 A live DJ spinning Madonna hits beginning a
