 irr at 8:00 p.m.\n⚾ Meet Ace\, the Toronto Blue Jays mascot\n📸 A TIFF
  photo booth and step-and-repeat with the performers and Ace\n🎁 Madonna
  vinyl giveaways\, courtesy of Warner Music Canada\n🍿 TIFF concessions 
 available for purchase\nWhere else can you celebrate Madonna's latest albu
 m\, snap a photo with Ace and settle in under the stars to watch one of th
 e greatest sports movies of all time?\nThe festivities begin at 7:00 p.m.\
 , with the free outdoor screening of A League of Their Own starting at 9:3
 0 p.m. at David Pecaut Square.\nBring your own blankets and lawn chairs.
LOCATION:David Pecaut Square
