 a9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Try the matchmaking event that's been dubbed "Yoga for your Lo
 ve Life" by singles\nIn this new world of online dating\, shallow conversa
 tions and superficial standards have become the norm...\nRobbing us of the
  magic that comes with connecting on a deeply meaningful level.\nThat's wh
 y\, here at Tantra Speed Date®\, we do speed dating a little differently.
 \nYou'll engage with your dates in a way that's fun\, authentic\, and even
  healing.\nWe'll guide you through a sequence of relationship-building exe
 rcises with up to 20 singles.\nEach exercise will aid you and your date in
  playfully exploring the depth of your connection. (Think verbal dyads\, m
 ovement/dancing\, and communication games!)\nAnd all of them enhance your 
 relationship skills in subtle\, yet powerful ways.\nSo you'll walk away no
 t only with matches...\nBut with the tools you need to bring more love int
 o your dating life!\nOver 31\,759 singles have gone on 232\,747 dates in 5
 0+ cities worldwide. 94.09% have matched with one or more dates. If you do
 n't match\, your next event is on us!\nGet your ticket today and experienc
 e the magic participants from New York to Vancouver–to now Amsterdam!–
 are raving about!\nSingles are raving about their tantra speed dating expe
 rience:\n* "Unquestionably the best dating event I have ever attended. It'
 s transformative!" -John N.\n* "I met the love of my life! I was hesitant 
 to go but I'm SO glad I did!" -Catherine B. (Denver)\n* "I now feel that I
  have a much deeper understanding of what it means to be a man in a relati
 onship and how to make dating a beautiful experience." -Justin M.\n* "I re
 ally felt like a goddess surrounded by strong\, beautiful\, empowered men.
 " -Brandi D.\nFor all dates in Toronto\, ON visit:\nhttps://www.tantrany.c
 om/speed-dating/toronto/\nFor all cities worldwide or to check out our FAQ
 \, visit:\nhttps://www.tantrany.com/speed-dating/\nURLs:\nTickets: https:/
 /go.evvnt.com/3697901-0?pid=4146\nWebsite: https://go.evvnt.com/3697901-2?
 pid=4146\nWebsite: https://go.evvnt.com/3697901-3?pid=4146\nWebsite: https
 ://go.evvnt.com/3697901-4?pid=4146\nFacebook: https://go.evvnt.com/3697901
 -5?pid=4146\nInstagram: https://go.evvnt.com/3697901-6?pid=4146\nInstagram
 : https://go.evvnt.com/3697901-7?pid=4146\nPrices:\nEarly Bird - Limited: 
 CAD 46.00\,\nGeneral Admission: CAD 55.00\,\nLast Minute) - Few Remaining:
  CAD 93.39\,\nDoor Sales (Cash only): CAD 150.00\nCategory: Lifestyle | Da
 ting\nDate and Time: 8th July 2026 at 7:00 pm to 10:00 pm\nVenue details: 
 The Unity Studio\, 1444 Dupont St Studio 19\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P 4H3\
 , Canada
