BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Resin on Canvas Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T220000
UID:blogto-236976@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/24/original_image0275e357-81e3-4c90-af0d-3a12a3004c
 06.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Mix\, pour\, and shimmer at this vibrant resin art experience 
 where you’ll create a stunning resin masterpiece on canvas with your own
  personal flair.\nWhat to Expect:\nExplore the beauty of resin as you desi
 gn your canvas using a wide variety of dyes\, pigments\, crystals\, gold/s
 ilver leaf\, glitters\, metallic flakes\, and other embellishments.\nThe f
 irst 1.5 hours will be dedicated to planning and designing your compositio
 n. You’ll then mix\, pour\, and layer your resin to bring your artwork t
 o life with beautiful\, fluid effects.\n### Creative Techniques\nLearn how
  to properly measure\, mix\, tint\, and pour resin onto canvas. Our instru
 ctor will guide you through layering techniques\, movement methods\, and h
 ow to achieve depth\, shimmer\, and dimension.\n### Materials Provided\nAl
 l materials are included:\n* Professional-grade resin\n* Canvas\n* Pigment
 s and decorative elements including gold\,silver leaf and glass crystals\n
 * Gloves\, respirator mask and protective equipment\n* Tools and supplies 
 needed for your project\nParticipants are welcome to bring small\, lightwe
 ight mementos (such as photos or thin sentimental items) to incorporate in
 to their canvas.\nSnacks & Refreshments: Complimentary tea\, coffee\, wate
 r\, and light snacks will be available.\nWho Should Join:\nOpen to ages 12
 +. No experience necessary.\n(Participants under 16 must be accompanied by
  at least one paying adult.)\nCuring & Pickup\nYour canvas is best to rema
 in at the studio to cure properly. Pieces will be ready for pickup the fol
 lowing weekend to allow for full curing and finishing. If pickup isn't pos
 sible\, participants can receive a to go box at their own risk.\nShipping 
 is available for an additional fee based on location.
LOCATION:Artbox Studio & Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-resin-on-canvas-workshop-toronto-4/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
