 uder. QE Trivia takes over the Fox with 2+ hours of pop culture mayhem\, h
 osted by the QE team — high energy\, high BPM\, zero boring questions.\n
 Both of you belong here.\nQE Trivia takes over The Fox on Thursday nights 
 with 2+ hours of World Cup-fuelled chaos — questions for the diehards\, 
 cliffnotes for the late joiners\, and enough pop culture in between that n
 obody's sitting one out. Hosted by the QE team: high energy\, high BPM\, z
 ero boring questions.\nTHE GAME\n10 categories spanning football\, music\,
  TV\, film\, celebrity culture\, and whatever's breaking the internet this
  week\nSurprise interactive rounds that reward quick thinking over deep kn
 owledge\nA final wager round that changes everything — and gives the und
 erdogs a real shot\nWHO SHOULD ATTEND The superfan who can name every play
 er in the Argentinian squad. The person who picked a team based on jersey 
