  the sport helps. Knowing how to have a good time is the only requirement.
 \n🌊 ELECTRIC ISLAND SUMMER TICKET GIVEAWAY 🌊 RSVP through Eventbrite
  = automatic entry into our Electric Island ticket raffle. Show up every w
 eek\, rack up your entries. Details from the host at each event.\nVENUE & 
 TICKET INFO Doors open at 6:30 PM — grab your seat early\, the Fox fills
  up fast.\nJoin the waitlist if tickets are sold out\n$25 minimum spend pe
 r person\nTHE GAME\n10 categories spanning music\, TV\, film\, celebrity c
 ulture\, and whatever's breaking the internet this week\nSurprise interact
 ive rounds that reward quick thinking and chaotic energy\nA final wager ro
 und that changes everything\nWHO SHOULD ATTEND The Fox already has great v
 ibes — we just turn them up to eleven.\nQE Trivia is for the crew that l
 oves a good time more than memorizing encyclopedias. Pop culture knowledge
 ? Nice to have. Good company and a competitive streak? Essential.\n🏆 PR
