 ncluding returning acts such as Spirit of Africa\, Poesy\, and Scarborough
  Uke Jam! New faces at Family Fest include storytelling\, music and dance 
 with Hi Blue Butterfly\, Rubena Sinha\,  Mâmawin’towin: A Métis Kitche
 n Party\, and many more!\nFamily Fest is entirely FREE of cost!\nGuild Fes
