 spired by lush greenery\, wildflowers\, and the charm of an English cottag
 e garden\, this guided Paint & Sip experience invites you to create your o
 wn floral masterpiece on Lazy Daisy Café's beautiful patio.\nEnjoy a hand
 crafted drink\, a delicious biscuit sandwich\, and a relaxing evening of c
 reativity surrounded by fresh air and floral inspiration. No experience ne
