 artists who defined generations.\nEnjoy an evening of classic hits\, soulf
 ul grooves\, delicious food\, refreshing drinks\, and outdoor patio vibes\
 , with DJ Carl Allen keeping the party moving throughout the night.\nWheth
 er you're a lifelong fan of R&B\, Soul\, Funk & Jazz or simply looking for
  a great night out in the city\, this is the perfect soundtrack for a summ
 er evening with friends.\nDoors: 8:00 PM\nAdmission: $20\nMusic by DJ Carl
