BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Night Circus Presents: Theatre de l'Amour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260710T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260710T233000
UID:blogto-237238@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/30/original_image6c8680a6-005c-48f6-ac79-6acb6b2b5a
 76.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Pilot Presents: The Night Circus Presents: Théâtre de l'
 Amour\nDoors: 8:00 PM\nPre-Show Experience: 8:00 PM – 9:00 PM\nPerforman
 ce: 9:00 PM – 11:30 PM\nLove is not a single story.\nIt is a series of t
 ransformations.\nThéâtre de l'Amour is a live narrative driven cabaret e
 xperience presented by The Night Circus. Performed by a live jazz ensemble
 \, vocalists\, and a cast of burlesque\, drag\, sideshow\, circus\, and th
 eatrical artists\, the production explores love through five distinct emot
 ional stages.\nStructured as a five act revue\, the evening journeys throu
 gh Ideal Love\, Desire\, Obsession\, Jealousy\, and Loss. Guided by a live
  MC and accompanied by a six-piece jazz band\, each act unfolds in its own
  theatrical style\, shifting between elegance\, chaos\, intimacy\, spectac
 le\, comedy\, and fantasy.\nRather than telling a single linear tale\, Th
 éâtre de l'Amour presents love as a collection of emotional states broug
 ht vividly to life through music\, movement\, storytelling\, and cabaret p
 erformance.\nThe Five Acts\n💘 Act I — Ideal Love\nThe dream. The fant
 asy. The perfect beginning.\n🔥 Act II — Desire\nAttraction\, temptati
 on\, and the thrill of pursuit.\n🌪 Act III — Obsession\nWhen longing 
 becomes all-consuming.\n🧿 Act IV — Jealousy\nPossession\, fear\, and 
 the unraveling of certainty.\n🖤 Act V — After Love\nHeartbreak\, memo
 ry\, transformation\, and what remains.\n🎷 Finale — Love Returned to 
 the Stage\nA celebratory curtain call bringing all five movements together
 .\nImmersive Cabaret Experience\nArrive early and explore a world beyond t
 he stage. Guests may encounter roaming characters\, tarot readings\, inter
 active theatrical moments\, hidden clues throughout the venue\, themed pho
 to opportunities\, visual art installations\, vendors\, and other surprise
 s woven into the atmosphere of the evening.\nTickets\nEarly Bird General A
 dmission: $35\nGeneral Admission: $40\nVIP Experience: $55\nVIP Includes:\
 n• Reserved table seating\n• Professional portrait photograph\n• A h
 andwritten love letter signed and kissed by the cast\nFive acts. One emoti
 on in five transformations.\nLove\, performed in stages.\nEnjoy 10% off fo
 od with your ticket before or after the show - available on our main floor
  or rooftop patio!
LOCATION:The Pilot
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-night-circus-presents-theatre-de-lam
 our-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
