UID:blogto-237256@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/30/original_image4f941843-1f98-4b9e-aabb-50c2a4164a
 c2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A 2hr workshop for new performers seeking explorative ways to 
 build presence & confidence on stage & in any room and support a worthy ca
 use!\nDragurlesque Expression Series: Character & Archetype in Performance
  w EL EXPERIMENTO ``- by WFP in support of a worthy Pro Palestine cause.\n
 PAY WHAT YOU CAN AT THE DOOR (CASH OR E-TRANSFER ~ SUGGESTED MIN: $10-50)\
 nFor new performers or creators looking for explorative ways to build pres
 ence and confidence on stage\, behind the mic or in any room. This Worksho
 p builds foundational character tools for drag and burlesque performance t
 hrough archetype exploration\, physical storytelling and performance exerc
 ises. Participants leave with practical tools to use in daily life or in a
 ct/persona development.\nREGISTRATION FILLING UP FAST!\nHosted by WFP - Wo
 rkshops for Progress - all proceeds after running fees will go directly to
  Tony and his family of 7 who are currently surviving the West Bank in an 
 effort to support their safe passage to safety. Keep an eye out for regula
 r workshops of all kinds.\nBring comfortable clothes and yourself!\n@_el_e
 xperimento has electrified Canadian and international stages since 2022. A
  fusion of nostalgic heartthrobs\, smouldering heartbreakers\, and chaotic
  hell-raisers\, he brings Latin flare\, hunky charm\, and gender disruptio
 n that bend time and space on every stage. A choreographer\, actor\, and m
 entor\, his work has been featured at Pride Toronto\, Hamilton Pride\, Lum
 inato\, the Austin International Drag Festival (2024)\, and the Toronto Bu
 rlesque Festival (2025).
LOCATION:Kula Yoga Studio
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/character-archetype-in-performance-with-
 el-experimento-toronto/
