BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hogtown Roller Derby presents: The Fresh and The Furious 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T170000
UID:blogto-237429@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/05/original_image217509b7-1fd7-4446-8eb4-2dfd13c99f
 29.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Two days of action-packed\, LGBTQ+ friendly\, roller derby! Th
 e 'The Fresh and The Furious' roller derby tournament returns to Toronto J
 uly 11 and 12 at Larry Grossman Forest Hill Memorial Arena (340 Chaplin Cr
 escent).\nHogtown Roller Derby League — named after Toronto’s cheeky 1
 9th century “Hogtown” nickname (earned by its reputation as a booming 
 pork processing industry) — has been hosting this one-of-a-kind tourname
 nt for new roller derby players known as 'The Fresh and The Furious' for t
 he last 14 years\, making it one of the longest running roller derby tourn
 aments worldwide.\nTorontonians are invited to come watch the full-contact
  action all weekend long (Saturday and Sunday from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m.)\, wh
 ere they can immerse themselves in the uplifting roller derby community\, 
 and see for themselves that everyone has a place on the derby track.\nGene
 ral admission tickets for the weekend are $20 while kids under 12 get free
  entry — purchased in advance at the tournament website or in person.  S
 kate equipment and fun merchandise will be sold at the event.\nFor tracksi
 de seating\, we recommend bringing a blanket or camp chair! A team of ASL 
 interpreters will be available to ensure accessibility for deaf and hard-o
 f-hearing spectators.\nIt’s a great opportunity to learn about the leagu
 e as a curious fan or an aspiring skater\, since Hogtown hosts two Derby 1
 01 sessions every year (10 week programs running in the fall and winter) a
 nd is always welcoming new players and volunteers to the league.\nHeader i
 mage: Hogtown at Fresh and The Furious 2024 by roller derby photographer D
 arren Stehr.
LOCATION:Larry Grossman Forest Hill Memorial Arena
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/hogtown-roller-derby-presents-the-fresh-
 and-the-furious-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
