 99.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Paint\, shop\, jam & play! Art market\, Family Activities\, So
 ulful R&B\, Roots Reggae and Jazz\, plein-air painting competition & more!
 \nJoin us on Saturday\, July 11 from 11:30 AM - 5 PM for the 4th Annual Ne
 ilson Park Creative Festival a free\, family-friendly celebration of art\,
  music\, food and community!\nSpend a summer afternoon exploring everythin
 g Neilson Park Creative Centre has to offer. Whether you're discovering lo
 cal artists\, enjoying live performances\, creating with your family or si
 mply relaxing in the park\, there's something for everyone.\n🎶 Live Mus
 ic All Afternoon\nEnjoy an exciting lineup of outdoor performances featuri
 ng soulful R&B\, Roots Reggae\, Jazz and more. Grab a seat and find a spot
  in the shade and enjoy great music throughout the day.\n🛍️ Shop Loca
 l\nBrowse a vibrant outdoor marketplace featuring artists\, makers and cra
 ftspeople offering original artwork\, jewellery\, ceramics\, textiles\, ho
 me décor\, handmade gifts and more.\n🎨 Plein-Air Painting Competition\
 nWatch artists paint outdoors in real time as they capture the beauty of t
 he grounds during our annual Plein-Air Painting Competition. Finished work
 s will be exhibited and awards presented later in the afternoon.\n🧒 Fam
 ily Art Activities\nDrop in for free hands-on art activities designed for 
 children and families. Create\, experiment and make something special to t
 ake home.\n🏛️ Explore Art Indoors\nStep inside the Centre to experien
 ce IMPACT 2026\, NPCC's largest and most anticipated annual juried art exh
 ibition\, featuring more than 70 outstanding art pieces from artists acros
 s the region. You'll also discover demonstrations and displays from NPCC's
  Resident Groups.\n🍔 Food & Refreshments\nTake a break and enjoy delici
 ous food and treats available throughout the day.\n🚗 Free Admission & P
 arking\nAdmission is free\, and free on-site and street parking are availa
 ble. NPCC is a fully accessible venue with washrooms\, seating areas and a
 ccessible entrances.\nGather your friends and family and celebrate creativ
 ity\, community and summer at the Neilson Park Creative Festival 2026!
