 n Film Centre in the city's picturesque Bridle Path neighbourhood. Celebra
 ting its eighth year\, the beloved lifestyle event has become one of Toron
 to's signature summer experiences\, bringing together thousands of guests 
 dressed in their finest pink and white attire for a day of elevated picnic
 king and celebration. This year's event welcomes Barbados Tourism Marketin
 g Inc. as the Official Destination Partner\, bringing the vibrant spirit o
