 r the event\n🌦 RAIN OR SHINE\nHonestly… if we’re already planning a
  water fight\, rain just feels like bonus production value.\n🧡 PLAY NIC
 E\nThis is a joyful\, public\, community event.\nBe respectful. Be playful
 . Don’t target unwilling strangers.\nConsent applies even during aquatic
  chaos.\nInvite your crew. Share the event. Hydrate ironically.\nToronto d
 eserves at least one afternoon a year that feels like a cartoon. 🐠💥\
 nSee you soaked\,\nTeam Urban Playground Toronto
