BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TFS Presents a Jacques Demy Double Bill!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T170000
UID:blogto-235806@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/31/original_image81bf983a-6c0f-4f03-9b4f-a7662e209b
 c2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step into the world of Jacques Demy with a French double featu
 re that’s equal parts dreamy and devastating. Lola (1961) sets the tone 
 with Anouk Aimée in a performance that’s cool\, tender\, and unforgetta
 ble – a story of love and timing told with quiet elegance. Then The Umbr
 ellas of Cherbourg (1964) turns the dial all the way up: Catherine Deneuve
 \, Michel Legrand’s soaring music (including “I Will Wait for You”)\
 , and colours that practically glow as the romance deepens into heartbreak
 . Two masterpieces\, one filmmaker\, and a big-screen experience that’s 
 going to stay with you long after you leave the theatre!\nLola (1961)\nJac
 ques Demy’s Lola is French romance with a bittersweet edge – all\nchan
 ce meetings\, missed timing\, and lingering feelings. Anouk Aimée is\nmag
 netic in the title role\, bringing warmth and mystery to a character you\n
 can’t quite forget. Stylish\, wistful\, and quietly devastating in the b
 est way\,\nit’s a film that rewards the big screen - where the atmospher
 e and emotion\nreally settle in!\nThe Umbrellas of Cherbourg (1964)\nA can
 dy-coloured knockout of a musical where every line is sung\, The\nUmbrella
 s of Cherbourg is pure cinematic emotion. Catherine Deneuve is\nluminous a
 t the centre of it all\, and Michel Legrand’s score is the kind that\nge
 ts under your skin and stays there - including the unforgettable “I Will
 \nWait for You.” Romantic\, heartbreaking\, and visually electric\, this
  is one of\nthose films that feels made for a theatre - you don’t just w
 atch it\, you get\nwashed over by it.\nBuy your tickets here: https://para
 diseonbloor.com/purchase/534878/
LOCATION:Paradise Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tfs-presents-a-jacques-demy-double-bill-
 toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
