 9b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Under the open sky of Toronto’s iconic High Park\, Shakespea
 re’s beloved romantic comedy comes to life. When Viola is shipwrecked an
 d disguises herself as a man\, she sets off a whirlwind of mistaken identi
 ties\, mischievous schemes\, and tangled romances.\nAs disguises unravel a
 nd hearts collide\, Twelfth Night delivers laughter\, music\, and the joyf
 ul chaos of love. Pack a picnic\, gather your friends\, and enjoy a summer
  night of theatre under the stars.
LOCATION:High Park Amphitheatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/twelfth-night-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
