BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women's Hammock Sound Bath
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260712T193000
UID:blogto-237484@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/06/original_image392f4bb9-ad99-4570-9019-a14db69fe5
 ad.jpg
DESCRIPTION:There are some things only women understand.\nThe soft exhaust
 ion we carry.\nThe way our bodies remember.\nThe ways we hold\, and hold\,
  and hold…until we are finally held.\nThis is a sound bath sanctuary jus
 t for women. A space to exhale without apology\, to drop the burdens\, and
  to be lovingly suspended in hammocks and sound vibrations move through yo
 u.\nHere\, there is no need to explain yourself. No need to shrink. No nee
 d to scan the room. No male presence. No male gaze. Just women. Just rest.
  Just breath.\nLet your nervous system soften in this sacred space.\nLet y
 our body remember what it feels like to feel safe.\nLet the sound we’ve 
 through your body\, your heart\, your bones\, gently unwinding all that yo
 u’ve been carrying.\nCome as you are.\nLeave as more of who you are.\nPO
 TENTIAL BENEFITS OF A HAMMOCK SOUND BATH\n• Deep Relaxation: The gentle 
 rocking of the hammock combined with intentional sound frequencies can lul
 l your body into a deeply relaxed state\, helping to relieve stress and an
 xiety.\n• Enhanced Circulation: Being suspended in the air allows for op
 timal blood flow and circulation\, promoting physical well-being.\n• Pai
 n Alleviation: The weightlessness of the hammock may reduce pressure on th
 e joints and muscles\, providing relief from chronic pain or tension.\n•
  Emotional Liberation: The sound vibrations may help release emotional blo
 ckages\, fostering a sense of emotional balance and clarity.\n• Sleep Re
 imagined: Many participants report improved sleep patterns after a hammock
  sound bath\, as the experience helps reset the nervous system and promote
 s a state of calm.\n• Spiritual Connection: The combination of sound hea
 ling and gentle swaying can facilitate a deeper connection with your inner
  self\, enhancing your spiritual practice.\nWHAT SHOULD I BRING?\nPlease w
 ear comfortable clothing and socks\, and bring along any preferred comfort
  items (pillows\, blankets\, etc). Outside food and drink are not permitte
 d in the studio.\nLATE ARRIVAL IS NOT PERMITTED.
LOCATION:Jungle Flower Wellness
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/womens-hammock-sound-bath-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
