 gto.com/events/2026/06/30/original_image47c99010-30a4-4dc4-af13-8b9014f167
 2a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:SUNFEST goes to DROM! Each year we welcome amazing acts coming
  to the Sunfest festival in London\, Ontario.\nFrom France & Senegal to To
 ronto\, get ready to get their live energy straight to you!\nFresh out of 
 Dakar\, Guiss Guiss Bou Bess has carved out a unique hybrid universe: Elec
 tro Sabar. The bustling\, vibrant neighborhoods of the Senegalese capital 
 serve as their laboratory\, a place where they capture local atmospheres\,
  record traditional drums\, and engineer infectious beats.Constantly seeki
 ng new sonic territories\, this French-Senegalese trio overflows with a "d
 iluvial" eclecticism\, shattering traditional codes with urban sounds\, fu
 rious rhythms\, and powerful percussion.Their music is a seamless fusion o
 f deep bass pulses and the ancestral heritage of the Wolof griots.As a pow
 erful symbol of contemporary Africa\, Guiss Guiss Bou Bess promises "inten
 se turbulence"and high energy performances wherever they go.
LOCATION:Drom Taberna
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-night-of-contemporary-african-music-at
 -drom-taberna-with-guiss-guiss-bou-bes-toronto/
