 gto.com/events/2026/06/29/original_image4b528111-c55a-4f4e-be83-62c8be9ce6
 b8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:RSVP here! 🎟️ https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/board-game-desi
 gner-night-snakes-lattes-annex-tickets-1238010154699?aff=BlogTO\nJoin us a
 t Snakes & Lattes Annex every month for Board Game Designer Night!\nIntere
 sted in game design? Have board game ideas? Want to playtest games before 
 anyone else? Come join our monthly Game Designer Night and meet local desi
 gners - open to public\, not just designers! 🥳\nFind your people or jus
 t chill after work\, in Toronto's coolest board game bar and restaurant.\n
 What to expect?\n-Playtest board game prototypes from designers\n-Enjoy ou
 r full service food and drinks\n🎲If you're a Game Designer:\n-Meet like
 -minded creators to exchange ideas with\n-Show and teach your game to othe
 r Game Designers and General Public\n-Get feedback from new and experience
 d players\nYou can find us every month at Snakes & Lattes Annex\, from 6pm
  until close.\nIf you’d like to play board games from the Snakes & Latte
