BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bleeding Edge Presents: TORONTO APARTMENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T220000
UID:blogto-237345@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/02/original_imagee62b07db-18d1-42aa-9f56-5227914d82
 78.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On July 15\, Bleeding Edge invites you to join us at Paradise 
 Theatre for the Canadian premiere of Toronto Apartment\, the laugh-a-minut
 e DIY comedy from local writer/director/editor Tristan Wheeler.\nBleeding 
 Edge previously played Wheeler’s short films Poet Laureate and I’m Sor
 ry Cody\, and we are excited to also bring you his feature debut! Toronto 
 Apartment was made for $10\,000 with the assistance of many people within 
 the Bleeding Edge community. Lock\, a recently dumped layabout\, rents out
  his apartment for an hour or two at at a time as a “community space” 
 in order to pay the bills\, which triggers a dangerous series of events fo
 r both Lock and the city of Toronto. It had it’s world premiere last mon
 th at the Mammoth Lakes Film Festival\, where rural California audiences l
 earned about the cost of housing in Toronto and our uniquely Canadian affo
 rdability crisis. Wheeler\, along with many of his collaborators\, will be
  in attendance for a Q&A at the screening.
LOCATION:Paradise Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/bleeding-edge-presents-toronto-apartment
 -toronto/
