 b7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get creative at Artbox’s Resin Art Workshop\, a hands-on exp
 erience where you’ll mix and pour your way to stunning decorative and fu
 nctional art pieces.\nExplore the beauty of resin as you choose from a var
 iety of projects such as canvases\, coaster sets\, trays\, and more. With 
 full creative freedom\, you’ll experiment with colourful pigments\, flor
 als\, metallic flakes\, glitters\, and embellishments to design pieces tha
 t are uniquely yours—all guided step by step by our instructor.\nWhat’
 s Included:\n• Choice of project: canvas\, coasters\, charcuterie boards
 \, tray moulds\, and other options\n• Guided instruction on mixing\, pou
 ring\, layering\, and effects\n• All resin\, tools\, gloves\, masks\, mo
 ulds\, and embellishments\n• Relaxed studio vibe with music and creative
  flow\n• Complimentary coffee\, tea\, refreshments\, and snacks\nCuring 
 & Pickup:\nPieces can be picked up from the studio or shipped within Ontar
 io for $20 (shipping cost may vary by location).\nWho Can Attend:\nOpen to
