 54.jpg
DESCRIPTION:One of the Philippines' most iconic girl groups is coming to T
 oronto for a major cultural entertainment event."\nLegendary Filipino Girl
  Group Coming to Toronto in 2026.\nPresented by Aptitude Events & Entertai
 nment in partnership with NY Entourage Productions and Backstage Ventures\
 , the event is expected to attract fans from across Ontario and neighborin
 g provinces.\nOn July 17\, 2026\, Toronto will host "Sexbomb Get Get Aww! 
 Toronto" at the Great Canadian Casino Resort. The event brings one of the 
 Philippines' most recognizable female performance groups to Canada for a m
 ajor live show.\nToronto is home to one of the largest Filipino communitie
 s in North America\, making this a significant cultural and entertainment 
 event for the city.
