 efining their practice\, this workshop guides you step-by-step through ske
 tching\, layering\, blending\, and building highlights and shadows to crea
 te realism and vibrancy. You’ll learn time-honoured oil painting techniq
 ues with supportive guidance throughout.\nGuided Instruction:\nLearn found
 ational oil painting methods from an experienced artist—from initial ske
 tch to final detail work—using layering\, glazing\, and observation of l
 ight.\nCreative Freedom:\nCustomize your painting with your own tones\, br
 ushwork style\, and level of realism or looseness.\nAll Materials Included
 :\nHigh quality oil paints\, brushes\, palette knives\, apron\, stretched 
 canvas\, to-go box\, and all other necessary supplies are included.\nRelax
 ed Studio Atmosphere:\nEnjoy a relaxed\, inspiring space with soft music a
 nd uplifting creative energy.\nSnacks & Refreshments:\nComplimentary coffe
