 a5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Every day\, we search online for information and images to fin
 d ourselves and understand our place within the world and in the deeper cu
 rrents of history.\nJoin MOCA for an illuminating and timely presentation 
 by Dr. Amy Marshall Furness\, a Wikipedia editor\, scholar\, educator and 
 Chief Librarian of Victoria University.\nFurness will discuss how we build
  reliable information online\, and why information literacy and community 
 participation in creating and maintaining information are more important t
 han ever in the age of AI.\nA Q&A session will follow. Limited capacity. R
 egister today to secure your seat.
