 gto.com/events/2026/05/14/original_imagea14279af-e1b7-42fd-ac0d-b586cd7fdd
 3e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join Toronto Dog Moms for a walk through one of Toronto’s mo
 st historic and charming neighbourhoods.\nAbout this event: Toronto Dog Mo
 ms and the Old Town Toronto BIA invite you and your dog to explore the sto
 ried streets of Old Town\, where heritage architecture\, cultural landmark
 s\, and vibrant local businesses come together to create a truly unique ex
 perience. With its cobblestone character and welcoming atmosphere\, this n
 eighbourhood is a favourite for locals and visitors alike.\nExpect to unco
 ver hidden gems\, connect with fellow dog lovers\, and enjoy a relaxed sto
 p at a local dog-friendly patio - the perfect way to unwind and take in th
 e historic surroundings.\nJoin us for an afternoon that celebrates Old Tow
 n Toronto’s rich past\, lively present\, and its love for dogs.
