BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amalfi Summer: Paint & Sip Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T170000
UID:blogto-236682@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/17/original_image7382824b-54ed-4c3a-86e6-05b20fa52d
 d0.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Escape to the Italian coast for a relaxing summer afternoon fi
 lled with creativity\, citrus\, and sunshine.\nJoin us at Anga's Farm & Nu
 rsery for a beautifully curated outdoor paint and sip experience inspired 
 by the charm and beauty of Italy's Amalfi Coast. Our thoughtfully decorate
 d outdoor setting will transport you to a Mediterranean summer\, complete 
 with lemon trees\, citrus-inspired décor\, vibrant colours\, and pictures
 que gathering spaces designed to make you feel as though you've stepped in
 to a seaside Italian village.\nDuring the experience\, you'll create your 
 own hand-painted lemon coaster set while enjoying refreshing premium lemon
 ade mocktails and a selection of lemon-inspired desserts and sweet treats.
  With light instruction and plenty of creative freedom\, this experience i
 s perfect for both beginners and seasoned artists alike.\nDesigned as a re
 laxed social gathering rather than a traditional art class\, Amalfi Summer
  Paint & Sip invites you to slow down\, connect with others\, and enjoy an
  afternoon of creativity in a beautiful outdoor setting. Sip refreshing le
 monade\, indulge in citrus-inspired treats\, and immerse yourself in the a
 tmosphere of an Italian summer without ever leaving the city.\nYour Experi
 ence Includes:\n• A complete set of coaster tiles to paint and take home
 \n• All paints\, brushes\, and art supplies\n• Light artistic guidance
  and inspiration\n• Premium handcrafted lemonade mocktails\n• Lemon-in
 spired desserts and baked treats\n• Italian-inspired décor and lemon tr
 ee displays\n• Access to our beautifully styled outdoor gathering space\
 nWhether you're looking for a unique afternoon with friends\, a creative o
 uting\, or simply an opportunity to enjoy the beauty of summer\, this expe
 rience offers the perfect blend of art\, relaxation\, and Mediterranean ch
 arm.\nCome sip\, paint\, and experience the magic of an Italian summer\, w
 ithout leaving Toronto!\nFor more details & to sign up\, visit our website
 ! www.angasfarm.ca!
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/amalfi-summer-paint-sip-workshop-toronto
 /
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
