BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Sopa del Dia: Sonic Sancocho at Rhythm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T180000
UID:blogto-237413@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/04/original_image424bf7d4-ef6d-48c6-a05c-8b2a917b5c
 4a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:La Sopa del Día - It's a day party - Sonic Sancocho style!\nJ
 oin the city’s only collective celebrating Latin culture\, cuisine and m
 usic through its namesake soup - Sancocho - at this chill afternoon jam in
  collaboration with Rhythm on Sunday\, July 19.\nSonic Sancocho founders\,
  olasconola and Juana Go-gó\, will warm up the space as you arrive\, foll
 owed by a full crate of top-tier vinyl selections by local DJ\, Derby Duro
  (Changó)\, plus a special guest set by Toro Moratto of the trailblazing 
 La Pambelé - Bogotá\, Colombia’s next gen salsa brava group\, as an ex
 clusive stop on their national tour.\nComplimentary cup of Sancocho for ti
 cket holders - please note: first come\, first served.\nAbout Sonic Sancoc
 ho: The spice of life in sound\, shared with the community. Much like ingr
 edients in a universal dish - a big pot of soup - here\, platters of sound
  are spun and served with warm welcome. Musical ingredients from around th
 e world\, from a local perspective\, for all to share and enjoy. Founded b
 y selectresses olasconola &  Juana Go-gó in Toronto\, Canada\, Sonic Sanc
 ocho is a community gathering of music and food - two things that nourish 
 heart and soul.They bring forth the B Sides and the beloved of Latin music
 \, with sounds from around the world\, to your venue through all-vinyl DJ 
 sets and dynamic live performances. Sancocho is where all of the ingredien
 ts come together and are shared amongst one another - from the starches to
  the spices and everything in between. We turn up the heat to bring it to 
 a boil\, coming together to enjoy a moment of connection through a serving
  of soup\, within layers of sound\, endless movement and fun.
LOCATION:Rhythm
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/la-sopa-del-dia-sonic-sancocho-at-rhythm
 -toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
