 uiz in town that pops with personality and the right amount of chaos!\nWHA
 T TO EXPECT Insomnia already has the late-night energy — we bring the ga
 me. QE Trivia's signature format hits Bloor West on Wednesdays and Sundays
 \, hosted by the QE team with enough charisma to keep the whole room locke
 d in.\nTHE GAME\n10 categories of pop culture\, music\, film\, TV\, and vi
 ral moments\nLightning rounds and in-house challenges (Rock 'Em Sock 'Em w
 ith staff is always iconic)\nMonthly cumulative leaderboard — the most c
 onsistent team wins big across both nights\nWHO SHOULD ATTEND Whether you'
 re a trivia veteran or someone who shows up for the vibe and accidentally 
 learns something — Insomnia trivia is for you.\n🏆 PRIZES Insomnia run
 s some of the best prize setups in the city — rotating weekly and monthl
 y prizes that include:\nMonthly leaderboard prizes (gift cards\, exclusive
  experiences)\nWeekly rotating sponsor prizes chosen by the host\n1st plac
 e picks first\, 2nd picks second — strategy is real\n🌊 ELECTRIC ISLAN
 D SUMMER TICKET GIVEAWAY 🌊 RSVP through Eventbrite to earn raffle entri
 es for Electric Island tickets. Attend both Wednesday and Sunday nights to
  double your chances.\nVENUE & TICKET INFO Game starts at 7 PM — doors o
 pen at 6:30 PM.\nWaitlist available if sold out\n$25 minimum spend per per
