 gto.com/events/2026/06/23/original_image75563714-56ad-4681-b831-025331e19a
 9d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:What began as a prayer call for the music industry in 2018 has
  evolved into the most exciting act in both Christian and Dance music.\nRa
 ve Jesus made waves last year with the release of a debut album\, garnerin
 g widespread acclaim and taking the stage at events both domestically and 
 internationally. More than just an artist\, Rave Jesus is a collaborative 
 movement challenging the conventions of modern worship music by reimaginin
 g it through the lens of dance music.\nWith a decade-long solo career as a
  DJ\, King Topher boasts impressive credentials\, including over 200 milli
 on Spotify streams\, tracks charting on the Billboard Dance Top 25 and U.S
 . Dance Radio Top 20\, and support from global heavyweights like Diplo\, J
 ohn Summit\, Chris Lake\, Tiesto\, and Kaskade. His music has reverberated
  across the world\, earning play at renowned festivals such as Tomorrowlan
 d - the world’s largest dance music festival.\nPreviously signed to Repu
 blic Records\, Repopulate Mars\, Hexagon\, Atlantic\, Interscope and Spinn
 in’ records\, 2026 brings a new chapter for Topher as he births his own 
 label\; Axiom Label Group.
LOCATION:Mod Club
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/rave-jesus-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sherman's March  4K Restoration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T214500
UID:blogto-237159@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/29/original_image523cee13-7cf6-44a8-98f2-428bab6a6c
 32.jpg
DESCRIPTION:40th Anniversary Screening\nWinner—Grand Jury Prize\, 1987 S
 undance Film Festival\nIn this classic doc from 1986\, director Ross McElw
 ee sets out to make a film about a famous campaign during the American Civ
 il War. But when a nasty breakup knocks him off course\, his historical in
 vestigation turns into a deeply revealing and hysterically unsuccessful se
 arch for love. The resulting “meditation on the possibility of romantic 
 love in the South today” is a comedic delight\, an eclectic road movie p
 ropelled by McElwee’s wry narration and his eagle eye for offbeat Americ
 ana. In the 30 years since its initial award-winning release\, Sherman’s
  March has only grown in stature and influence\, securing a reputation as 
 one of the great comedic masterpieces in the history of documentaries. It
 ’s the crowning achievement of one of American cinema’s most original 
 voices. Will Di Novi\, Hot Docs
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/shermans-march-4k-restoration-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Single While Christian" Speed-Mixer Social Event --All ages--
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T183000
UID:blogto-236773@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/19/original_image13878ad7-d654-4082-868b-d8e6d646d1
 f9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This speed mixer combines elements of speed dating & a social 
 mixer. It is open to all denominations including Orthodox & Catholic.\nPLE
 ASE READ FULL DESCRIPTION BELOW\nSEVERAL OF OUR PAST EVENTS WERE SOLD OUT!
  During our events\, people have had so much fun that they stayed behind a
 fter the event to have dinner/drinks with several of the attendees as a gr
 oup!\nThis singles speed mixer will combine the elements of speed dating a
 nd also a social mixer. Bring your business cards as this is also an oppor
 tunity for networking and meeting new friends.\nWe will start with free ti
 me for mingling followed by a few rounds of a group icebreaker activity an
 d games. Attendees will then have a few rounds of 7 minutes to chat with a
 nyone of their choice and at the sound of the bell will select another per
 son to chat with. It is better than speed dating as you are not obligated 
 to sit and speak with all attendees!\nNo need to be nervous\, just remembe
 r that everyone is in the same boat. All you have to do is show up and jus
 t start talking to anyone even someone of the same gender! Come with an op
 en mind and positive outlook as you never know who you may meet and where 
 it may go.\nTICKET INCLUDES AN ALCOHOLIC/NON-ALCOHOLIC DRINK.\nAttendees a
 re encouraged to exchange contacts at the event but there will also be pie
 ces of paper for attendees to write down names of those who they are inter
 ested in and can hand it into the host afterwards. who will then send an e
 mail to the attendee enquiring if there is a mutual interest. If there is 
 found to be mutual interest then the person's contact information will be 
 shared with you with their consent. (If you are asked for your contact inf
 ormation at the event but do not feel a romantic vibe with the person\, yo
 u can always let them know that you would be happy to exchange contacts bu
 t that you feel more of a friendship vibe).***Often emails from the host t
 o attendees are blocked\, Hotmail is notorious for this\, therefore partic
 ipants are strongly encouraged to exchange contacts at the event itself. F
 eel free to provide honest feedback to the host so future events and atten
 dees can benefit.\nDress to impress! No extremely casual clothing.\nThe ev
 ent will start promptly so please arrive early. Parking can be found in ne
 arby parking lots and side streets (free on Heath street).\nIf the gender 
 ratio is very unbalanced\, the event will be postponed. Please check your 
 email (including spam/junk inboxes) a day before the event and also after 
 the event for important updates and information. Emails regarding event in
 fo and also connecting with individuals post-event often goes to people's 
 junk boxes! If you did not receive pre-event emails from us\, please conta
 ct us at TorontoGTAsingles@gmail.com.\nAs the gender ratio is controlled\,
  we will admit people without a ticket at the door only if they have been 
 accepted to do so in advance - Please email us at TorontoGTAsingles@gmail.
 com prior to showing up at the door to make sure you will be accepted. The
 re is important information that is provided prior to the event that must 
 be read before attending.\n-----------------------------------------------
 ---------------------------------------------\nFor future events\, follow 
 us on:\nEventbrite: https://www.eventbrite.ca/o/torontogtasingles-71157368
 103\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61550921856331\nJoi
 n one of our 3 Facebook groups:\nSingles ages 50+ https://www.facebook.com
 /groups/4598240670401181\nSingles of all ages https://www.facebook.com/gro
 ups/1118178702580538\nSingle Christians https://www.facebook.com/groups/19
 01396200328809\nOr send an email to TorontoGTASingles@gmail.com and ask to
  be added to our mailing list.\n**We are doing a matchmaking project for a
 ges 50+ get on our list by sending us a message with your email address.\n
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ----------------------------\nAre you a Genuine\, Trustworthy and Availabl
 e (GTA) single looking to network with like-minded individuals for friends
 hips\, business opportunities\, and love? Come out to an event!\nAttendee 
 requirements:\n-be "emotionally available" i.e being open\, present\, and 
 fully engaged in a relationship\, sharing feelings\n-looking for a serious
 \, meaningful long-term relationship\n-looking for monogamy\n-have space i
 n your life for a special someone (good work-life balance)\n--------------
