 r info@vinbon.ca and visit www.vinbon.com to learn more about their produc
 ts and services.\nREGISTER HERE: https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events
 -richmond-hill\n- VENUE: VinBon Richmond Hill\n- ADDRESS: 10620 Yonge St\,
  Richmond Hill\, ON\n- PARKING: Free\, onsite.\nEVENT ITINERARY:\n* 6:00-7
