 17.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Think you know a little bit about everything? Grab your smarte
 st friends and compete in a night of fast paced pub trivia at The Pilot!\n
 Join us on Wednesday\, July 22nd for a night of Pub Trivia hosted by Almos
 t Jeopardy!\nFrom pop culture\, movies\, and music to sports\, history\, i
 nternet chaos\, and completely random facts you forgot your brain stored a
 way\, this game covers a little bit of everything. Whether you are a seaso
 ned trivia regular or just looking for a fun night out with friends\, this
  is your chance to put your knowledge to the test.\nExpect quick thinking\
 , friendly competition\, great food and drinks\, and a packed room full of
  teams battling for bragging rights and gift cards.\nHOW IT WORKS\n3 Round
 s\, 10 Questions each\nRound 1: General Knowledge - anything goes!\nRound 
 2: Theme Round - a new theme is announced each week @AlmostJeopardy so stu
 dy up!\nRound 3: Almost Jeopardy?* Round - two sets of five questions insp
 ired by our favourite game show\nFinal Question - It all comes down to thi
 s: bet your points on one last question. Our glorious winners will be crow
 ned smartest team in the room and you'll walk away with great prizes from 
 Hemingway's.\n* not affiliated with the show in any way\, obviously\nTRIVI
 A DETAILS\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed drink\
 , and get settled in.\n❓ First question at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be lat
 e.\n🏆 The top three teams win a Pilot gift card valued between $50 and 
 $100.
LOCATION:The Pilot
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/pub-trivia-hosted-by-almost-jeopardy-tor
 onto-6/
