DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Art Hive at MOCA\, a free art-making programme that
  invites you to create on select Thursday evenings!\nJoin us Thursday\, Ju
 ly 23 for Art Hive at MOCA\, a free art-making programme that invites you 
 to stop by and create! This season\, Explore textile and film works by art
 ist Kimsooja on MOCA’s Floor 1.\nEach Art Hive session is unique\, featu
 ring creative invitations written by graduate students from the Toronto Ar
 t Therapy Institute. You’ll be invited to respond to a prompt that encou
 rages you to consider MOCA’s current exhibitions while connecting with y
 our community.\nAs part of MOCA’s commitment to accessible programming\,
  Art Hive is free to attend and all materials are provided for suggested a
 ctivities.
