DESCRIPTION:Join us for three unforgettable evenings of non-stop music\, d
 elicious food\, and incredible vibes at the Beaches International Jazz Fe
 stival StreetFest! From July 23rd to July 25th\, we're turning the iconic
  stretch between Woodbine and Beech Avenues into the ultimate music destin
 ation.\n🚦 Street Closes at 6:00 pm\n🎸 Bands Start at 7:00 pm\n🎶 
 Live Music Galore 🎶\nGet your groove on with an electrifying lineup of
  amazing bands and musicians\, ready to rock your world! From Jazz and sou
 lful Blues to high-energy Rock and everything in between\, Queen St. E.  
 will be bursting with captivating performances that will keep you dancing 
 all night long!\n🍔 Foodie Paradise 🍔\nTantalize your taste buds wi
 th a diverse array of mouthwatering treats from the city's best restaurant
 s & food trucks. From gourmet eats to sweet delights\, there's something t
 o satisfy every craving.\n🎉 Fun for All Ages 🎉\nStreetFest is a c
 elebration for the whole family!  Bring the kids along for an unforgettab
 le experience that will have them talking about it for weeks to come!\n
 🛍️ Shop 'til You Drop 🛍️\nDiscover unique treasures and suppor
 t local artisans as you stroll through our vibrant market stalls. Whether
  you're on the hunt for handmade crafts or trendy fashion finds\, our vend
 ors have you covered.\n📍 Location: Queen St. East (between Woodbine & 
 Beech Aves)\n📅 Dates: July 23rd\, July 24th\, July 25th\n⏰ Time: St
 reet closes at 6:00 pm\, Bands start at 7:00 pm\nSpread the word\, invite 
 your friends\, and let's make this summer's StreetFest one for the books
 ! See you there! 🎤🎉
