BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PARC Benefit Concert: Presented by Not Dead Yet!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T230000
UID:blogto-236551@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/15/original_image08d9b5b5-0374-46c4-a410-2ce28d6219
 7c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Not Dead Yet! is hosting a benefit for PARC\, on July 23rd\, w
 ith 9 MILLION\, S.H.I.T.\, SIYAHKAL\, DUCHESS\, DIATRIBE and DJ MEG REMY.\
 nPARC (Parkdale Activity-Recreation Centre) has been a force in Parkdale f
 or almost 50 years. They have spent those years providing support for peop
 le facing mental health and substance use challenges\, homelessness\, pove
 rty\, and food insecurity. They provide two hot meals a day\, housing supp
 ort\, employment support and\, most importantly\, community.\nAt PARC\, th
 e act of walking through the door qualifies people to receive the support 
 they're looking for. It's a drop-in space with art and recreation\, as wel
 l as case management\, harm-reduction\, and employment services. It's a co
 mmunity of people looking out for each other\, built on the simple idea th
 at everyone deserves a home\, a job\, a friend and a neighbourhood.\nPARC 
 are literal neighbors of many of the people playing this show. All proceed
 s from this event will be going to PARC to support their initiatives and t
 o continue supporting our most vulnerable neighbours. This is meant as a t
 rue show of support\, by the community for the community. This is a great 
 way to prove it\, with numbers.\nTickets are on sale now. The fine folks a
 t Dice have waived ticketing fees for us on this one. You will only pay th
 e mandatory tax + credit card processing. There are $30 tickets\, $20 tick
 ets for students\, and a $60 pay-it-forward ticket that will allow a membe
 r of PARC to attend free of charge.
LOCATION:The Parkdale Hall
