 hers the 2026 Toronto Biennial’s thematic exploration of disruption as a
  generative force.\nOpening July 24\, 2026\, Dawoud Bey: Material Historie
 s\, Living Landscapes is presented at the AGO\, in partnership with the To
 ronto Biennial of Art\, as part of its 2026 edition\, entitled Things Fall
  Apart.\nImage Credit: Frank Ishman
