 join our free talks about tarot cards\, metaphysical healing practices\, \
 , and other metaphysical topics led by our experts.\nFor more information 
 on The Gem Expo\, visit TheGemExpo.com\nFor more information on The Meta E
 xpo\, visit TheMetaExpo.com\nCost:\n$12 per day or $22 for all 3 days\nStu
 dents (High School & University) & Seniors (65+) $6\nKids 12 andunder free
 .\n$2 discount available online subscribers\nWhere:\nHyatt Regency Toronto
