BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hammock Sound Bath for Overthinkers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260725T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260725T203000
UID:blogto-237485@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/06/original_image4d9274be-1edf-4c9e-b596-2db02dfd8c
 92.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A restorative evening of breath and sound to calm the noise wi
 thin.\n**Because we will be doing deep belly breathing\, it is important t
 o attend this event on an empty stomach**\nFor those with racing minds\, w
 e welcome you to join us for an experience designed to help you step out o
 f your head and into a space of calm and centredness.\nWe’ll begin with 
 gentle\, beginner-friendly pranayama\, an ancient yogic breathwork techniq
 ue that uses breathing to calm the nervous system and quiet mental chatter
 . You’ll learn simple yet powerful breathing exercises to focus your min
 d\, increase oxygen flow\, and shift your body into a state of relaxation.
  This grounding practice sets the perfect foundation for the meditative ex
 perience that follows.\nNext\, settle into a cozy hammock for a sound bath
 \, where the vibrations of singing bowls\, gongs\, rattles\, and other ins
 truments wash over you. The rich\, resonant tones are designed to help you
  release tension\, clear energetic blocks\, and guide you into a deep stat
 e of rest. As the soundwaves interact with your body and mind\, you may ex
 perience a sense of lightness\, clarity\, and inner stillness\, perfect fo
 r quieting the overthinking mind.\nJoin us and let the powerful combinatio
 n of breath and sound bring ease to your body and mind.\nPOTENTIAL BENEFIT
 S\nWhen Pranayama is paired with a Sound Bath\, the benefits are amplified
 \, creating a powerful synergy for mind-body healing. Here’s how they wo
 rk together:\n• Calms the Nervous System More Deeply: Pranayama has the 
 power to activate the parasympathetic nervous system\, preparing the body 
 for deep relaxation\, while the sound bath sustains and deepens this state
 .\n• Quiets Mental Chatter More Effectively: Focused breath work may sti
 ll the mind\, making it more receptive to the soothing vibrations of the s
 ound bath\, which further dissolves overthinking.\n• Enhances Breath Awa
 reness and Energy Flow: Pranayama can clear energetic blockages\, allowing
  the sound frequencies to travel more freely through the body for a deeper
  healing experience.\n• Deepens Meditation and Inner Stillness: Breath C
 ontrol carries the potential to bring you into the present moment\, and th
 e immersive sound bath can shift you into a meditative state with ease.\n
 • Supports Emotional Release and Stress Reduction: The breath work can c
 reate space for emotions to move\, while the sound waves help to release t
 ension and stagnant energy.\nTogether\, pranayama and sound have the poten
 tial to create a profoundly restorative experience\, leaving you feeling l
 ighter\, clearer\, and more connected to your body.
LOCATION:Jungle Flower Wellness
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/hammock-sound-bath-for-overthinkers-toro
 nto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
