 gto.com/events/2026/07/04/original_image8db65e0a-0bd5-4869-8025-fe638273cd
 31.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's food-inclusive experience returns with reimagined Ca
 ribbean-inspired flavours\, tropical cocktails powered by Wray and Nephew 
 & Appleton Estate\, music\, games\, and island vibes.\nLooking for unique 
 food events in Toronto? Munchiez is a curated food-inclusive social experi
 ence that brings together local chefs\, creative food vendors\, immersive 
 hospitality\, and an incredible community of food lovers.\nDesigned for cu
 rious\, culture-minded guests\, The Island Edition celebrates the vibrant 
 flavours of the Caribbean through reimagined dishes\, handcrafted cocktail
 s\, and unforgettable experiences.\nYour ticket includes:\n🌴 A curated 
 tasting menu featuring Caribbean-inspired creations from Toronto chefs and
  vendors\n🎶 Live music\, interactive games\, and a vibrant social atmos
 phere\n🍹 Access to an exclusive signature cocktail menu featuring Apple
 ton Estate and Wray & Nephew rums (available for purchase)\nWhether you're
