 b8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:THE TERMINAL THEATRE PRESENTS\nTHE ANIMATED GARDEN\, BY MOONLI
 GHT BALLET\nThe Animated Garden is an ode to Le Jardin Animé\, a jewel of
  the classical ballet repertoire first presented in Marius Petipa’s 19th
  century revival of Le Corsaire. Moonlight Ballet reawakens this living ga
 rden in a new light.\nThe story begins in the present day and follows the 
 fates of three artists\, but reality and imagination begin to blur. Inspir
 ed by the theatrical spectacle of the Gardens of Versailles\, the journey 
 unfolds through a sequence of shifting scenes—ornamental pathways\, cura
 ted florals\, exquisite sculptures\, and dramatic fountains.\nTicket Infor
 mation\n$45-75 - plus service fees\, CIF & HST
