BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:THE THREE GARDENS: Growing Your Garden of Love
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260725T113000
UID:blogto-237431@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/05/original_image5820af69-420e-407d-9680-fc181f32f2
 dc.jpg
DESCRIPTION:THE THREE GARDENS: Growing Your Garden of Love\nWhat you water
  grows.\nThis is a 90-minute in-person workshop in Toronto exploring how i
 nner patterns shape your daily life.\nMost of what we experience externall
 y begins internally. This workshop offers a structured way to observe thos
 e patterns with more clarity and awareness.\nWe will explore this through 
 The Three Gardens framework.\nTHE THREE GARDENS\nThe Inner Garden\nYour th
 oughts\, emotions\, beliefs\, and self-talk.\nThe Shared Garden\nHow you r
 elate to others—closeness\, distance\, connection\, and conflict.\nThe L
 iving Garden\nHow these patterns shape your choices\, direction\, and dail
 y life.\nWHO THIS IS FOR\nThis is for you if you:\nYou notice repeating pa
 tterns in your life.\nYou want deeper self-understanding.\nLife has felt a
 utomatic or disconnected.\nYou want a space to pause and reset.\nWORKSHOP 
 DETAILS\nDate: Saturday July 25\nTime: 10:00 AM to 11:30 AM\nLocation: Cen
 tre for Social Innovation (CSI Spadina)\, Toronto\nEntry details shared af
 ter registration\nCapacity: 10 people (intentionally small)\nEarly Bird pr
 icing is available until July 18.\nCLOSING\nYou do not need to force chang
 e. It begins with noticing what you are already feeding.\nWhat you water g
 rows.\nCANCELLATION POLICY\nAll bookings are final.\nIf you are unable to 
 attend\, your spot may be transferred to another person with advance notic
 e. We understand plans can change.
LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-three-gardens-growing-your-garden-of
 -love-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
