 hering where we'll move\, reflect\, sip tea\, and spend a couple of hours 
 fully offline.\nWhat's Included\n🧘 Outdoor Yoga with Emma from Flow wit
 h Breath\nLed by Emma\, a psychotherapist and yoga teacher\, this all-leve
 ls class blends mindful movement\, breathwork\, and nervous system regulat
 ion to help you feel grounded and refreshed.\n📖 Guided Journaling with 
