 journal prompts designed to encourage self-awareness and meaningful conver
 sations.\n🥣 Açaí Bowl by HEAL\nRefuel after yoga with refreshing aça
 í bowl from HEAL Wellness\, made with wholesome ingredients and perfect f
 or a summer morning.\n🍵 Cold Brew Tea Tasting by Chin Tea Studio\nDisco
 ver Chalin Tea's Five Elements Wellness Collection\, inspired by ancient E
 astern wisdom. Enjoy complimentary cold-brew tea tasting during the event\
 , with wellness tea packs available for a special event price of $5 (regul
 ar $6.99).\nWhether you're coming solo or with a friend\, this is a chance
  to slow down\, touch some grass\, and meet people who enjoy wellness\, go
 od conversations\, and supporting local businesses.\nEvent Details\n📅 S
 aturday\, July 25\n🕘 9:00 AM – 11:00 AM\n📍 Ramsden Park (beside Ro
 sedale Station)\nPlease bring:\nA yoga mat\nWater bottle\nComfortable clot
