 94.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Take a journey beyond the ordinary and explore your soul’s c
 osmic connections.\nThere is still so much we do not know about what exist
 s beyond Earth. Countless galaxies\, dimensions\, and forms of consciousne
 ss remain unexplored by the human mind\, yet we are still part of this gre
 ater cosmic whole.\nAs part of this summer's Mystic Arts Fair\, Galactic O
 rigins: A Guided Journey to the Stars is an invitation to journey beyond t
 he ordinary and explore your personal galactic connections — whether tha
 t relates to your soul’s origins\, celestial resonances\, curiosity abou
 t extra-terrestrial societies\, or worlds whose wisdom may help illuminate
  our own.\nPerhaps you have always felt connected to the Pleiadians\, Orio
 n’s Belt\, Sirius\, or certain planetary energies. Perhaps Jupiter has a
 lways called to you. Or perhaps you simply feel curious about what exists 
 beyond this realm.\nThrough a guided hypnotic journey led by Esné\, a Tra
 nspersonal Hypnosis Specialist\, you will be invited to access deeper stat
 es of consciousness and travel toward the realms\, beings\, and wisdom mos
 t aligned with your path at this time.
LOCATION:The Plant Mystic
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/galactic-origins-a-guided-journey-to-the
 -stars-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
