 onsite with children.\nSunday May 31 Theme: Forest Friends\nSunday June 28
  Theme: Bees\, Butterflies & Bugs!\nSunday July 26 Theme: Musical Melodies
 \nSunday August 30 Theme: Fabulous Flowers\nSunday September 27 Theme: Gar
