  meet high quality people.\nYour ticket includes a whiskey flight or cockt
 ail\, light appetizers\, and up to 20 short dates with our most liked spee
 d daters. This event is not for everyone\, as it priced a lot higher than 
 all of our other events. It's meant for those who are serious about their 
 dating\, and want to meet like minded people.\nHow speed dating works is t
 hat you will meet members of the opposite sex for short dates\, pull up th
 eir profile on your phone\, and give them a Like or Pass. They will then d
 o the same thing for you. Mutual matches will be sent out the next day.\nW
 e will give you all needed materials\, and explain the process to you once
  everyone has arrived. You don't need to bring anything\, but please do co
 me dressed to impress.\nThis event is for professionals in their 30s and 4
 0s.\nNote: Women's tickets are invites only. Please attend one of our regu
 lar events first if you'd like to get on our special invites list.
