BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wait\, What's Sri Lanka? An Hour of Stand Up with Shenuque
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260730T220000
UID:blogto-237266@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/30/original_image005de98d-79eb-4517-ad50-13bd106eaa
 5c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Shenuque is bringing their comedy special to Toronto for two n
 ights as they continue their stand up tour\nWait\, What’s Sri Lanka? is 
 a one hour stand-up special\, written by Shenuque and directed by Sunny La
 prade\, for anyone who has ever felt invisible. The show explores the joy 
 of embracing all parts of your identity while navigating the pain of not f
 eeling seen. Shenuque uses a narrative stand-up style to talk about their 
 life through the lens of being Sri Lankan and how that intersects with the
 ir other identities. The show reveals how interconnected we all are. Regar
 dless of whether or not you're Sri Lankan\, this show is for you. Topics i
 nclude race\, gender\, sexuality\, and of course\, aunties. If you enjoy s
 tand-up comedy that weaves together humor with a compelling narrative\, yo
 u will enjoy this show.\nAll graphics are designed by Elliot Davis.\n*Venu
 e has a 1 item minimum\nBio:\nShenuque is a Sri Lankan American comedian b
 orn and raised on Staten Island. Their stand-up is infused with a passion 
 for storytelling and an enrapturing stage presence. They are currently tou
 ring their debut stand-up special\, Wait\, What’s Sri Lanka?\, a show fo
 r anyone who has ever felt invisible. They’ve graced the stage in Off-Br
 oadway productions and contributed their writing talents to HBO Max. They
 ’ve worked as a director for the Murmuration Theater Company and co-foun
 ded the award-winning podcast studio Many Sided Media\, where you can regu
 larly hear their voice acting on the show My First Dungeon. Audiences have
  said that Shenuque is like if Hasan Minhaj\, Tiffany Haddish\, and John M
 ulaney were in a polycule and didn’t let Shenuque in\, so he modeled his
  comedy after all of them.
LOCATION:Free Times Cafe
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/wait-whats-sri-lanka-an-hour-of-stand-up
 -with-shenuque-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
