 rtists across three days.\nThe Phase 1 and single-day lineups have been an
 nounced\, featuring major electronic music icons:\nMainstage Headliners: A
 rmin van Buuren\, Above & Beyond\, FISHER\, Illenium\, and a massive Kx5 (
 deadmau5 & Kaskade) reunion.\nKey Performers by Day (Selection):\nFriday\,
  July 31: Charlotte de Witte\, Boys Noize\, Subtronics\, and Black Tiger S
 ex Machine.\nSaturday\, August 1: ARTBAT\, Galantis\, James Hype\, and Mis
 s Monique.\nSunday\, August 2: Sara Landry\, Slander\, Mau P\, and Lost Fr
 equencies.\nAdditional Artists: Frank Walker\, Ray Volpe\, Level Up\, Madd
 ix\, and many more.\nTickets available @ https://eventschaser.com/?s=Veld+
 Music+Festival+Toronto
