DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s Favourite Bodega Comedy Show Returns to Liberty Vi
 llage\nLiberty Laughs returns on Friday\, July 31\, bringing some of Canad
 a’s best comedians to a one-of-a-kind venue tucked away in the heart of 
