BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wait\, What's Sri Lanka? An Hour of Stand Up with Shenuque
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260731T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260731T210000
UID:blogto-237267@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/30/original_image124aec16-37cd-4a7e-955d-495389f053
 84.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Shenuque is bringing their comedy special to Toronto as they c
 ontinue their stand up tour\nWait\, What’s Sri Lanka? is a one hour stan
 d-up special\, written by Shenuque and directed by Sunny Laprade\, for any
 one who has ever felt invisible. The show explores the joy of embracing al
 l parts of your identity while navigating the pain of not feeling seen. Sh
 enuque uses a narrative stand-up style to talk about their life through th
 e lens of being Sri Lankan and how that intersects with their other identi
 ties. The show reveals how interconnected we all are. Regardless of whethe
 r or not you're Sri Lankan\, this show is for you. Topics include race\, g
 ender\, sexuality\, and of course\, aunties. If you enjoy stand-up comedy 
 that weaves together humor with a compelling narrative\, you will enjoy th
 is show.\nAll graphics are designed by Elliot Davis.\n*Venue has a 1 item 
 minimum\nBio:\nShenuque is a Sri Lankan American comedian born and raised 
 on Staten Island. Their stand-up is infused with a passion for storytellin
 g and an enrapturing stage presence. They are currently touring their debu
 t stand-up special\, Wait\, What’s Sri Lanka?\, a show for anyone who ha
 s ever felt invisible. They’ve graced the stage in Off-Broadway producti
 ons and contributed their writing talents to HBO Max. They’ve worked as 
 a director for the Murmuration Theater Company and co-founded the award-wi
 nning podcast studio Many Sided Media\, where you can regularly hear their
  voice acting on the show My First Dungeon. Audiences have said that Shenu
 que is like if Hasan Minhaj\, Tiffany Haddish\, and John Mulaney were in a
  polycule and didn’t let Shenuque in\, so he modeled his comedy after al
 l of them.
LOCATION:Free Times Cafe
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/wait-whats-sri-lanka-an-hour-of-stand-up
 -with-shenuque-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
