 h expert dog training insights\, bringing together dog lovers\, comedy fan
 s\, and community members for an unforgettable experience.\n🎟️ Ticket
 s are just $20. Your ticket covers your meal and is not your charitable do
 nation. Donations made before or during the event go directly to support t
 he Baycrest Foundation and the Toronto Humane Society.\n🐾 What to expec
 t:\nStand-up comedy from top local performers\nLive dog training panel + a
 udience Q&A\n🎉 Interactive experiences: charity auction (featuring priz
 es from The Othership\, AJ’s Spaw\, Circle & Squares\, Pawswithbonds\, S
 tanley\, Toronto Maple Leafs tickets\, and a Great Lakes Brewery prize pac
 k) + a photo booth to capture the fun\n🎁 Loot bags courtesy of Global P
 et Foods Davisville\nA chance to connect with fellow dog lovers\nA fun\, w
 elcoming atmosphere for a great cause\n🍺 Giving Back:\nGreat Lakes Brew
 ery will be donating $1 from every 20oz beer sold during the event to supp
 ort our partner charities and contributing a special prize pack to the auc
 tion\, as well as hosting us.\n🐶 Dog-Friendly Event:\nDogs are welcome!
  They can be in all areas except the kitchen. For everyone’s safety\, if
