 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Taste of the Danforth is Canada's largest street festival\, dr
 awing more than 1.5 million visitors each year to Toronto's vibrant Danfor
 th Avenue. Spanning a full weekend\, the festival transforms the neighbour
 hood into a celebration of food\, music\, culture\, and community\, featur
 ing hundreds of local businesses\, live entertainment\, family-friendly ac
 tivities\, and interactive experiences.\nRooted in the area's rich Greek h
 eritage\, Taste of the Danforth has grown alongside both the Danforth and 
 Canada itself. As the neighbourhood has become increasingly diverse\, so t
 oo has the festival\, evolving into a celebration of the many cultures tha
 t now call Toronto home. Visitors can enjoy an incredible variety of cuisi
 nes from around the world\, experience performances by artists representin
 g cultures from every corner of the globe\, and discover one of the city's
  most vibrant and multicultural communities.\nFrom the World Stage and cul
 tural dance performances to patios\, food vendors\, shopping\, and communi
 ty activations\, there's something for every age and interest. Whether you
 're visiting for the famous food\, the live entertainment\, or simply to s
 oak in the atmosphere\, Taste of the Danforth is the perfect way to experi
 ence Toronto's multicultural spirit... with a dollop of tzatziki on top.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/taste-of-the-danforth-festival-toronto/
