 b5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Not sure if your plant actually needs repotting\,  or if it’
 s better left alone? This informative seminar takes the guesswork out of r
 epotting and helps you understand exactly when\, why\, and how to repot yo
 ur houseplants with confidence.\nWe’ll cover the signs your plant is rea
 dy for a new pot\, how to choose the right container and soil\, and common
  mistakes that can cause stress or slow growth. You’ll also learn how di
 fferent plants respond to repotting and when it’s best to wait.\nPerfect
  for beginners and plant lovers alike\, this seminar will give you the kno
 wledge and confidence to support healthy root growth and keep your plants 
 thriving.\nIncluded with registration: Each participant will receive a tra
 nsplanting fertilizer to help get you started on your repotting journey at
  home!\nVisit our website for more details & to sign up! www.angasfarm.ca
