 help dissolve the mystery of getting your writing into journals\, magazine
 s\, and elsewhere. The workshop will explore the basic intricacies of loca
 ting publication venues\, writing brief cover letters\, and tracking your 
 responses. Writers are expected to have their work published\, for any var
 iety of reasons\, so let's take some time and talk about HOW to do that!\n
 There may even be some time for guided prompted writing and personalized r
 ecommendations on where you should be sending your work!
LOCATION:Comedy Bar East
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/intro-to-creative-publishing-toronto/
