 gto.com/events/2026/03/26/original_image48e04d7d-f549-4d14-bc80-20e02b3b63
 82.jpg
DESCRIPTION:In this immersive TFS Summer Academy\, participants work with 
 Toronto Film School instructors to explore the craft of acting in a suppor
 tive\, hands-on environment. You’ll develop foundational skills includin
 g character work\, script analysis\, blocking\, stagecraft\, and camera aw
 areness while learning how to be authentic and truthful in a role.\nGuided
  by experienced industry professionals\, you’ll prepare scenes for both 
 live performance and industry-standard self-tapes\, building confidence\, 
 control\, and expressive range. This week-long Acting Academy offers an in
 troductory look at the same practical\, industry-focused training delivere
 d in Toronto Film School’s full-time Acting for Film\, TV and Theatre Di
 ploma Program.\n***Applicants must be 18 years of age or older.\nToronto F
 ilm School – Summer Acting Academy for Adults!\n•	August 10 to 14 from
