 er\, mayhem\, and duplicity are on the menu in this classic 1963 romantic 
 comedy thriller. Returning from a chic ski holiday\, jetset expat Regina L
 ampert (Hepburn) meets Peter Joshua (Cary Grant) and their playful chemist
 ry crackles. While in bold romantic pursuit of this dashing man of many al
 iases\, Reggie and Peter are soon capering around Paris\, pursued by crook
 s who worked with her late husband. In danger and under suspicion\, Reggie
  has accidentally fallen into an embezzlement scheme and must prove her in
 nocence and defend herself from the real criminals. $18/$15
