 gto.com/events/2026/06/20/original_image98c08358-cfc0-4386-81bb-c5da550a8d
 4e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the ultimate excuse to play with your food.\nStart 
 with a generous pour of premium chocolate — vegan dark\, milk\, or white
  — then raid our stacked topping bar (sweet\, sour\, salty\, crunchy\, u
 mami\, and totally unhinged picks). These are flavour combos you won’t f
 ind in the grocery aisle. Your mission: make a take-home treat that’s 10
 0% you.\nWe’ll hook you up with pro chocolate-making moves — minus the
  TV chef drama — so your creation tastes amazing and looks next-level. Y
 our masterpiece? Wrapped and ready to flex (or demolish) by the end of the
  night.\nExpect good tunes\, friendly faces\, and chocolate trivia with pr
 izes 🏆. Open to ages 12+\, this is for anyone who loves to experiment\,
  mash up wild flavours\, and bend a few “food rules” just because. Rol
 l in with a date\, bestie\, sibling\, or work crew — you’ll leave with
  something delicious and brag-worthy.\nYour ticket includes:\n- Your choic
 e of vegan dark\, milk\, or white chocolate\n- Access to our stacked toppi
 ng bar (sweet\, sour\, salty\, crunchy\, umami & wild cards)\n- Step-by-st
 ep tips from our friendly chocolate pros\n- All tools + supplies to make y
 our dream chocolate\n- Fun\, low-pressure creative time in our cozy Libert
 y Village spot\nHosted at QUEST XO’s Creative Lab in Liberty Village\, w
 here chocolate gets a little rebellious.
LOCATION:QUEST XO
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/chocolate-making-top-it-like-its-hot-fla
 vour-bark-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
