 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Orchard Floral Experience | Workshop\nJoin us for an unfor
 gettable afternoon of fresh-cut flowers\, sparkling apple cider\, and flor
 al arranging beneath the apple trees at Anga's Farm & Nursery.\nNestled on
  one of Toronto's last remaining family-run farms\, this unique orchard ex
 perience offers a chance to slow down\, reconnect with nature\, and celebr
 ate the beauty of the growing season. Surrounded by rows of apple trees an
 d the peaceful atmosphere of the farm\, you'll enjoy a thoughtfully curate
 d gathering designed to inspire creativity\, conversation\, and connection
 .\nThe experience begins with a visit to our flower garden\, where you'll 
 hand-select and harvest beautiful dahlias and seasonal blooms for your arr
 angement. Guided by our team\, you'll learn simple floral design technique
 s as you create a lush\, garden-inspired centerpiece using the flowers you
 've picked yourself.\nThroughout the afternoon\, guests will enjoy sparkli
 ng apple cider\, seasonal orchard refreshments\, and a selection of homema
 de apple desserts and baked treats prepared with the flavours of the farm.
 \nWhether you're joining friends\, spending time with family\, or simply t
 reating yourself to a relaxing afternoon outdoors\, The Orchard Floral Exp
 erience is a beautiful way to celebrate flowers\, harvest season\, and the
  charm of country life in the city.\nYour Experience Includes:\n• Guided
  dahlia harvesting from our flower garden\n• A premium floral arranging 
 workshop\n• Fresh seasonal blooms\, foliage\, vessel\, and materials\n
 • Sparkling apple cider and orchard-inspired refreshments\n• Homemade 
 apple desserts and baked goods\n• A handcrafted floral arrangement to ta
 ke home\n• Exclusive access to our orchard gathering space\nVisit our we
 bsite for more details & to sign up! www.angasfarm.ca
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/angas-farm-floral-workshop-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
