 b8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a fun-filled Crawlathon/Walkathon for kiddos age
 s 0–7 years old\, where little ones can toddle\, crawl\, and walk their 
 way through an exciting community celebration! Families will enjoy a day p
 acked with food\, games\, parachute circle time\, music\, and other fun ch
 ildren’s activities designed to create joyful memories for kids and care
 givers alike.\nThe Big Toddle is an annual community fundraising event org
 anized by College-Montrose Children’s Place (CMCP). This family fun fest
 ival brings together children\, families\, local businesses\, and neighbou
 rs from across the community to celebrate early learning\, connection\, an
 d support.\nFor 13 years\, the Big Toddle has helped raise awareness and f
 unds for CMCP’s free early learning programs\, family support services\,
  and community foodbank — programs that provide essential resources and 
 a welcoming space for families.\nThis year\, we’re excited to celebrate 
 this milestone with our community and work toward our goal of raising $50\
 ,000. Every donation\, sponsorship\, and show of support helps us keep our
  doors open and ensures families continue to have access to high-quality\,
  free programs and supports.\nBring your little ones\, invite your friends
 \, and join us for a day of laughter\, play\, and community spirit. We can
 ’t wait to see you at the Big Toddle! 💛
LOCATION:Trinity Bellwoods Park
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-big-toddle-toronto/
