 gto.com/events/2026/06/14/original_image7fa3dd6f-dcd4-4c2f-9857-c26f3e97a9
 22.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto International Tap Dance Festival (TITDF/To Tap Fes
 t) is a biennial event for all ages produced by Toffan Rhythm Projects. Th
 is year\, it will take place on August 21-23.\nThere will be three days of
  programming featuring leading international and local tap dancers and mus
 icians\, as well as dancers traveling in from all over Canada. In total th
 e festival will be presenting 36 artists on stage over two days of shows\,
  as well as two days of tap dance workshops of various levels\, panel disc
 ussions\, and a closing night jam session.\nPlease visit the website linke
 d to this event for more details on festival schedules\, ticket purchases\
 , and workshop registrations. Follow @totapfest on Instagram and Facebook 
 to keep up with the latest announcements.\nGot any questions or interested
  in sponsoring our festival? Feel free to email Cathy at cathy.toffanrhyth
 mprojects@gmail.com
LOCATION:Multiple Venues
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-international-tap-dance-festival
 -toronto-3/
