 94.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A 4-Hour Darkwave Dance Cruise on the Jubilee Queen featuring 
 Mistress McCutchan and the Goth Barge DJ crew.\nWe are taking the barge ac
 ross the border for a massive night of darkwave\, industrial\, and post-pu
 nk rhythms on the water. Goth Barge presents our Toronto Maiden Voyage abo
 ard the Jubilee Queen.\nIf you have been waiting for us to make our intern
 ational debut\, now is your chance to catch the dark energy live on Lake O
 ntario. We are excited to bring a heavy lineup featuring Mistress McCutcha
 n\, X Dominion X\, and Dance Commandr. Grab your gear\, bring your energy\
 , and let's show Toronto how we set the vibe on the water.\nThe Jubilee Qu
 een offers the perfect setting for a dark cruise\, featuring a dual-deck l
 ayout that splits into a spacious enclosed lower lounge with a massive dan
 ce floor and an open upper deck offering panoramic views of the Toronto sk
 yline. The ship comes fully equipped with a completely stocked cash bar se
 rving up a full selection of beer\, wine\, and liquor to keep you moving a
 ll night long. Between sets\, you can step out onto the deck to take in th
 e waterfront views or hit the fully loaded bar inside.\nMake sure to arriv
 e early so you don't get left at the dock. Gates open and boarding begins 
 at 7:00 PM sharp\, with the boat leaving the dock at 8:00 PM. The cruise r
 eturns to land at 12:00 AM\, and final disembarkation runs until 12:30 AM.
LOCATION:The Jubilee Queen
