 92.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Heavy metal pioneers Iron Maiden brings the Run For Your Lives
  2026 World Tour to Scotiabank Arena in Toronto on August 29\, delivering 
 a thunderous night of metal legacy and pure spectacle. Known for their ela
 borate stage production\, relentless energy\, and decades of genre-definin
 g music\, Iron Maiden continues to set the standard for live heavy metal. 
 Fans can expect a career-spanning setlist featuring iconic anthems\, deep 
 cuts\, and new material\, all powered by Bruce Dickinson’s soaring vocal
 s and the band’s legendary triple-guitar attack.\nJoining this monumenta
 l night are special guests Megadeth and Anthrax\, two titans of thrash who
  helped shape the genre’s foundation. Megadeth brings razor-sharp riffs 
 and politically charged precision\, while Anthrax adds their explosive ene
 rgy and mosh-pit intensity to the mix. This lineup unites three of metal
 ’s most influential forces for an unforgettable night in Toronto—a cel
 ebration of power\, speed\, and decades of unrelenting sound.\nTickets ava
 ilable @ https://eventschaser.com/iron-maiden/
LOCATION:Scotiabank Arena
