BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:T.U. JAZZ FEST 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T220000
UID:blogto-236745@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/18/original_image8d985045-44d0-4747-8280-0e82b68637
 90.jpg
DESCRIPTION:T.U. Jazz Fest Returns to Mel Lastman Square for 12th Annual L
 abour Day Weekend Celebration\nCanada's Largest Jazz Festival for Emerging
  Artists Serves Up Free Music\, Grammy-Winning Talent\, Masterclasses.\nTO
 RONTO\, ON\, September 4 \, 2026 — Canada's largest jazz festival dedica
 ted to emerging artists\, T.U. Jazz Fest (TUJF)\, returns to Mel Lastman S
 quare from September 4–6\, 2026 for its 12th annual edition. Presented b
 y the Emerging Artists Association (EAA)\, the free\, family-friendly fest
 ival will transform the heart of North York into a three-day celebration o
 f jazz\, artist development\, cultural diversity\, and community connectio
 n.\nThe 2026 festival will feature more than 130 musicians from across Can
 ada and abroad\, including award-winning and internationally recognized ar
 tists from Canada\, the United States\, and Romania. Festival highlights i
 nclude Grammy Award-winning producer\, bassist\, and educator Justin Gray\
 , who will lead the festival's featured masterclass and perform as a speci
 al guest artist. Audiences will also enjoy performances by Grammy and JUNO
  Award-nominated keyboardist Jonny Tobin\, award-winning vocalist Julia D'
 Ascanio\, DownBeat Student Music Award recipient Sarah Leroux\, award-winn
 ing bassist and composer Josh Warren\, and many of Canada's most promising
  emerging jazz artists.\nTUJF2026 will also welcome Amphitrio\, an interna
 tionally acclaimed contemporary jazz trio from Romania. Recognized with mu
 ltiple international jazz awards and praised as one of the leading voices 
 of Romania's new jazz generation\, Amphitrio will appear as the festival's
  2026 Band of the Year
LOCATION:Mel Lastman Square
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tu-jazz-fest-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
