BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Canadian International Air Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T154000
UID:blogto-237470@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/06/original_image513d58b2-7668-45bc-bb71-636a87085b
 5f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The 77th Canadian International Air Show (CIAS) returns to To
 ronto’s waterfront this Labour Day weekend\, September 5 to 7\, 2026.\nT
 he Canadian Forces Snowbirds take centre stage for what is expected to be 
 their last CIAS performance before an extended hiatus. It's a milestone mo
 ment set against a full weekend of aerial excellence\, from precision form
 ations to heritage aircraft and high-energy aerobatic acts.\n\nOther 2026 
 Programming:\n- See the first ever appearance by the Jack Aces Formation A
 erobatic Team.\n- Watch the USAF F-16 Demo Team showcase the power and pre
 cision of modern military aviation.\n- Witness the amazing Pink Jet in act
 ion for its first CIAS appearance.\n- Trevor Rafferty is back and ready t
 o perform with the Christen Eagle.\n- Mike Tryggvason also returns and is 
 debuting a new Edge 540 V3 racer.\n- Indulge in a selection of local eats 
 at the Refueling Station and meet some of the show’s featured performers
 .\n- Explore the free STEM Zone\, featuring life-size aircraft displays\, 
 cutting-edge VR experiences\, and aerospace-themed exhibits.\nMake the mos
 t of your day\, Air Show tickets include same-day admission to the CNE gro
 unds.\nFor tickets please visit cias.org/tickets and visit cias.org for 
 more information. Follow CIAS on Instagram\, Facebook\, and Twitter for 
 updates and use #CIAS26.
LOCATION:Marilyn Bell Park
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/2026-canadian-international-air-show-tor
 onto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
