 nnection\, and collective action.\nEvent Details\n• Date: September 6\, 
 2026\n• Time: 1:00 PM – 4:00 PM\n• Location: 938 Danforth Avenue\, T
 oronto\, ON —\nRooftop\n• Refreshments: Food and beverages provided\n
 • Contact: info@livedexperience.com\n• Website: The Lived Experience S
 ummit is a community‑driven gathering designed to elevate the voices\, l
 eadership\, and expertise of people with lived experience across health eq
 uity\, social justice\, and community advocacy sectors. This rooftop event
  brings together residents\, organizers\, service providers\, and system l
 eaders for an afternoon of dialogue\, connection\, and collective action.\
 nEvent Details\n• Date: September 6\, 2026\n• Time: 1:00 PM – 4:00 P
 M\n• Location: 938 Danforth Avenue\, Toronto\, ON — Rooftop\n• Refre
 shments: Food and beverages provided\n• Contact: info@livedexperience.co
 m\n• Website: www.livedexperiencesummit.com\nWhat to Expect\n• Keynote
  storytelling from community leaders with lived experience\n• Interactiv
 e sessions focused on health equity\, transit justice\, and community empo
 werment\n• Networking opportunities with advocates\, organizations\, and
  coalition partners\n• Resource tables offering tools\, supports\, and p
 athways for civic engagement\nTicket Information\n• General Admission: F
 ree\n• Registration: Required to secure rooftop capacity\n• RSVP Link:
