BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Loud 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T230000
UID:blogto-237135@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/27/original_image87c7396c-d4b5-4dcf-8ef3-497037e20d
 29.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Live Loud 2026 returns to Toronto's iconic Massey Hall on Sept
 ember 10\, 2026\, for an unforgettable evening of live music\, storytellin
 g\, and community impact in support of mental health and substance use hea
 lth.\nPresented by Make Music Matter and Matthew Perry House\, Live Loud b
 rings together acclaimed Canadian artists\, advocates\, and community lead
 ers for a powerful night that celebrates recovery\, resilience\, and conne
 ction. Through inspiring performances and shared experiences\, the event r
 aises awareness and critical funds to support mental health initiatives an
 d recovery-focused programs across Canada.\nMore than a concert\, Live Lou
 d is a celebration of hope\, healing\, and the transformative power of mus
 ic to bring people together. Attendees will experience unforgettable perfo
 rmances\, moving stories\, and a shared commitment to creating a future wh
 ere recovery and mental well-being are accessible to all.\nMassey Hall is 
 a fully accessible venue with accessible seating\, washrooms\, and elevato
 r access throughout the building.\nJoin us for an evening where music meet
 s purpose and every voice helps make recovery louder.\nAbout Make Music Ma
 tter\nMake Music Matter uses music and therapeutic support to help vulnera
 ble communities heal from trauma and rebuild their lives with hope and dig
 nity. Its Healing in Harmony program has supported more than 19\,000 parti
 cipants across nine countries. https://makemusicmatter.org/\nAbout Matthew
  Perry House\nMatthew Perry House is a national initiative dedicated to su
 pporting individuals in recovery through community connection\, advocacy\,
  and dignity-focused care while reducing stigma around substance use healt
 h. https://matthewperryhouse.ca/
LOCATION:Massey Hall
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/live-loud-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Made For You - Posh Boutique x By Basics Collab
