BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walk for Suicide Awareness 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260913T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260913T120000
UID:blogto-237369@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/03/original_image2c2f4400-20ac-426e-ad6f-7d0934431a
 78.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Distress Centres of Greater Toronto (DCGT) returns for its
  annual Walk for Suicide Awareness on Sunday\, September 13. Hosted during
  Suicide Awareness Month\, the Walk brings the community together to honou
 r those lost\, challenge the stigma around suicide and fund life-saving su
 pport services.\nThe Walk will follow a scenic path of just under 4.5 km a
 long the shores of Lake Ontario. Participants are encouraged to donate or 
 lead fundraising efforts\, with all proceeds supporting DCGT’s free\, co
 nfidential\, 24/7 emotional support\, crisis intervention\, suicide preven
 tion and survivor support services.\nParticipants will receive a t-shirt a
 nd an Honour Bead necklace as a meaningful way to recognize personal conne
 ctions to the cause and remember loved ones lost to suicide.\nSnacks and r
 efreshments will be served following the Walk.\nRegister for the Walk for 
 Suicide Awareness today and join us as we walk toward hope\, healing\, and
  a stronger\, more connected community.
LOCATION:Sunnyside Pavilion
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/walk-for-suicide-awareness-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
