 ads the all-star female cast of this razor-sharp 1939 satire—her circle 
 of friends (and frenemies) include Rosalind Russell\, Paulette Goddard\, J
 oan Fontaine\, and gossip columnist Hedda Hopper\, supported by A-list cha
 racter actresses. Their foe is Crystal Allen (a delicious Joan Crawford)\,
  the ambitious and predatory perfume counter girl who has her sights on Ma
 ry’s guileless husband. $18/$15
