DESCRIPTION:2nd Edition of Public Health and Midwifery World Conference PH
 MWC 2026\nPrecision Global Conferences cordially invites you to the 2nd Ed
 ition of Public Health and Midwifery World Conference (PHMWC 2026)\, which
  will be held from September 18 to 20\, 2026\, in Miami\, Florida\, USA.\n
 The theme is “Transformative Practices in Public Health and Midwifery Ed
 ucation and Research.”\n\nThe 2nd Edition of Public Health & Midwifery W
 orld Conference (PHMWC 2026)\, scheduled for September 18-20\, aims to bri
 ng together researchers\, healthcare professionals\, policymakers\, and ac
 ademics from diverse fields to discuss critical issues and foster collabor
 ation in public health and midwifery. As the global healthcare landscape e
 volves\, addressing the health needs of communities and ensuring quality m
 aternal and newborn care has never been more vital. With growing challenge
 s in public health\, including maternal and child health\, infectious dise
 ases\, and chronic conditions\, this conference is an essential platform f
 or exploring new strategies\, innovations\, and best practices.\nFor more 
 information: https://www.publichealthmidwifery.com/\nFor Abstract Submissi
 on:https://www.publichealthmidwifery.com/abstract-submission.php\nTo regis
