 gto.com/events/2026/07/05/original_image874458cb-a66a-46c7-8a17-8da29e78ca
 a6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:One of drum and bass's most decorated and in-demand artists ma
 kes his way to Toronto for a night that is long overdue. BOU built his nam
 e from the ground up through the SoundCloud jump-up scene\, and turned tha
 t foundation into one of the most impressive careers in the genre.\nFour D
 rum and Bass Awards in a single year. A UK top 5 single alongside Chase an
 d Status. Major label releases on Island Records including "Wicked and Dar
 k" and a top 40 collaboration with Aitch. His own Gossip imprint\, stackin
 g up Beatport number ones. Support from Andy C\, Shy FX\, and the biggest 
 selectors in the scene.\nHis DJ sets carry the same energy as his producti
 ons. Expect jump-up\, rolling basslines\, and enough melodic instinct to k
 eep the floor moving from start to finish.\nSupport from RMS\, Remedy\, an
 d Szeto.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/bou-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
