BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mozart Extravaganza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T220000
UID:blogto-237486@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/07/06/original_image4026a1ad-444e-49c7-837f-210320d8e7
 ff.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Ontario Pops Orchestra proudly opens its 2026–2027 conce
 rt season with Mozart Extravaganza\, a dazzling evening devoted to the tim
 eless genius of Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\, on Saturday\, September 19\, 202
 6\, at 8:00 PM at Trinity-St. Paul's Centre\, located at 427 Bloor St. Wes
 t\, Toronto.\nFor this special occasion\, Artistic Director and Principal 
 Conductor maestro Carlos Bastidas has invited internationally acclaimed Ma
 estro Eduardo Diazmuñoz\, coming from Mexico to guest conduct the orchest
 ra in an extraordinary all-Mozart program. The evening will also feature d
 istinguished clarinetist Przemyslaw Raczynski as soloist.\nThe concert pro
 gram includes:\n• Overture to Il Re Pastore\n• Clarinet Concerto in A 
 Major\nSoloist: Przemyslaw Raczynski\n• Symphony No. 35 “Haffner”\nN
 ow celebrating over 11 years of artistic excellence\, the Ontario Pops Orc
 hestra has established itself as one of Ontario’s leading professional o
 rchestras\, recognized for its dynamic performances\, innovative programmi
 ng\, and commitment to making classical music accessible to diverse audien
 ces. With a growing reputation for artistic quality and a history of sold-
 out performances\, the orchestra continues to bring world-class musicians 
 and unforgettable concert experiences to the community.\n🎟 Tickets are 
 selling fast and seating is limited. Secure your seats early to avoid disa
 ppointment.\nTickets: $25\nAvailable online or at the door.\nFor tickets a
 nd more information\, visit: Ontario Pops Orchestra\nMedia Contact:\nOntar
 io Pops Orchestra\nontariopops@gmail.com\nwww.ontariopops.com
LOCATION:Trinity-St. Paul's Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/mozart-extravaganza-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
