BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Robert Davidson Walk for Pulmonary Fibrosis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T140000
UID:blogto-233705@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/15/original_imageb357a73b-7845-4f6b-8d54-562b51504a
 b4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Robert Davidson founded the Canadian Pulmonary Fibrosis Founda
 tion in 2009\, less than two years after his own diagnosis with idiopathic
  pulmonary fibrosis and just months before receiving a double-lung transpl
 ant. Through his courage and compassion\, Robert brought together patients
 \, families\, and healthcare professionals across the country\, helping ma
 ny Canadians live as fully as possible despite this devastating disease.\n
 Robert passed away on May 1\, 2019\, at the age of 71. His vision continue
 s to inspire the pulmonary fibrosis community\, and this walk carries forw
 ard his commitment to supporting those affected by the disease.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/robert-davidson-walk-for-pulmonary-fibro
 sis-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
