DESCRIPTION:The Roncesvalles Village BIA welcomes back their annual festiv
 al in September\, returning this year for its 20th anniversary!\nThis mile
 stone edition builds on the festival’s rich history\, featuring fan favo
 urites like polka and pierogi\, alongside an exciting focus on a broader r
 ange of local artists\, musicians\, and\, of course\, incredible food.\nLo
 cated in one of Toronto’s most vibrant\, unique\, and creative communiti
 es\, the festival pairs old world charm with the energy of today’s Ronce
 svalles Village. Visitors can enjoy a diverse selection of global cuisines
  from local eateries\, exceptional shopping\, and quality services\, along
  with live performances by talented artists and musicians\, and family fri
 endly activities.\nCome and celebrate from Saturday\, September 19th - Sun
 day\, September 20th!
LOCATION:Roncesvalles Village
