BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:3rd Edition of Infectious Diseases World Conference
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260921T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260921T180000
UID:blogto-231609@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/03/03/original_image1fd18139-c776-4b81-8cd3-3b4e64ba7d
 1e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:3rd Edition of Infectious Diseases World Conference (IDWC 2026
 )\nThe 3rd Edition of the Infectious Diseases World Conference (IDWC 2026)
  invites you to an extraordinary gathering of global health professionals\
 , scheduled for September 21–23\, 2026\, in the vibrant city of Miami\, 
 Florida\, USA.\nConference Theme: “Infection Prevention in Healthcare & 
 Beyond: Innovations and System Resilience.”\nThe 3rd Edition of the Infe
 ctious Diseases World Conference (IDWC 2026)\, scheduled from September 21
 –23\, 2026\, in Miami\, Florida\, is dedicated to expanding research hor
 izons in the domain of infectious diseases. This conference fosters creati
 vity and pioneering discoveries through international collaboration\, work
 ing together with a shared vision to address the critical challenges posed
  by communicable diseases. The conference emphasizes advancing the discipl
 ine through state-of-the-art scientific initiatives\, all aimed at enhanci
 ng our understanding of infectious diseases and formulating innovative con
 tainment strategies.\nInfectious diseases accounted for only one-sixth of 
 disability-adjusted life years (DALYs) lost. Thus\, infectious diseases po
 se a significant threat to human health and demand immediate research and 
 innovation to control their global impact. We'll see that the best organiz
 ing team shares your best work on the best platform. We'll work hard to ma
 ke the conference a success with the most rigorous planning. It would be a
 n incredible experience for you\, us\, and everyone attending the meeting.
 \nInfectious Diseases Conferences 2026\, Miami\, USA\, Infectious Diseases
  World Conference 2026\, Infectious Diseases World Conference\, Infectious
  Diseases Congress 2026\, Infection Conferences 2026\, Dermatological Infe
 ctions Conference\, Ophthalmological Infections Conference\, Neurological 
 Infections Conference\, Respiratory tract Infections Conferences\, Confere
 nces On Urinary Tract Infections\, Conference On Bacterial Infections 2026
 \, Parasitic Infections Conference\, Viral Infections Conference 2026\, Vi
 ral Infections Conference\, Noninfectious Diseases Events\, Infectious Dis
 eases Conferences\, Infectious Diseases Conference\, Infectious Diseases C
 onference\, Infectious Diseases Conferences 2026\, Infectious Diseases Mee
 tings 2026\, Infection Events 2026\, Infection Conferences\, Bacterial Inf
 ectious Diseases Conferences 2026\, Viral Infectious Diseases Conferences\
 , Fungal Infectious Diseases Conferences 2026\, Protozoan Infectious Disea
 ses Conferences\, Global Conference on Infectious Diseases 2026\, Pediatri
 c Infections\, Infection Control in Critical Care\, Disinfection and Steri
 lization\, Rare Infections Disease Conference\nFor more information: https
 ://www.infectiousworldconference.com/\nFor Abstract Submission: https://ww
 w.infectiousworldconference.com/abstract-submission.php\nTo register: http
 s://www.infectiousworldconference.com/registration.php\nReach out at: infe
 ctious@precisionglobalconferences.com\nOrganizers:\nPrecision Global Confe
 rence: https://precisionglobalconferences.com/\nAddress: 601 King St Ste 2
 00 #853 Alexandria\, VA 22314 United States\nEmail: infectious@precisiongl
 obalconferences.com\nPhone: +1-571-5561014
LOCATION:Hilton Garden Inn Miami Dolphin Mall\, FL\, USA
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/3rd-edition-of-infectious-diseases-world
 -conference-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
