 00.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We are pleased to announce the 2nd Annual Global Summit on Foo
 d Science\, Nutrition and Technology\, taking place September 24–26\, 20
 26\, at the Panorama Hotel in Prague\, Czech Republic.\nThis international
  summit will bring together renowned experts\, researchers\, and professio
 nals to explore the latest advancements and challenges in food science\, h
 uman nutrition\, and food technology.Set against the historic and innovati
 ve backdrop of Prague\, the event will feature keynote talks\, panel discu
 ssions\, and interactive workshops\, with a special focus on sustainable f
 ood systems\, emerging nutrition research\, and future food innovations.\n
 The summit offers a unique platform for networking\, collaboration\, and i
 nterdisciplinary dialogue among academics\, industry leaders\, and early-c
 areer researchers working toward a healthier\, more sustainable food futur
 e.\nJoin us in Prague for an engaging and impactful exchange of knowledge 
 that will shape the future of food and nutrition worldwide.
LOCATION:Panorama Hotel\, Prague\, Czech Republic
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/2nd-annual-global-summit-on-food-science
 -nutrition-and-technology-toronto/
