 nsult\nPrice: CAD 0.00\nCategory: Classes / Courses | Meetup and Networkin
 g\nDate and Time: Saturday September 26\, 2026 at 11:30 am to 5:30 pm\nVen
 ue details: Marriott Downtown at CF Toronto Eaton Centre\, 525 Bay Street\
