 69.jpg
DESCRIPTION:In Praise of Older Women (1978) is a Canadian drama produced b
 y Robert Lantos and directed by George Kaczender\, based on Stephen Vizinc
 zey's novel. It follows András Vayda (Tom Berenger) and his romantic enco
 unters with older women in post-WWII Hungary and Canada. The film launched
  Lantos’s career and is recognized for its controversial\, sexual\, and 
 "soft-core" nature at the time of its release. The movie is in English wit
 h English subtitles
