 25.jpg
DESCRIPTION:JMFEST is back again with JMFEST KA edition!\nJMFEST (J-MUSIC 
 FESTIVAL) is a live music and talent showcase event organized by J-rock No
 rth Promotions Inc. taking place in Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada. It showcas
 es up and coming artists\, as well as popular musicians\, from Japan and N
 orth America. Its aim is to promote a music exchange between Japan and Can
 ada through live concerts and presentations.\nVivarush is a high-energy en
 tertainment Visual Kei band dedicated to spreading excitement through thei
 r music and performances. Known as a self-proclaimed “age-mi crew\,” o
 r “hype-raising crew\,” they blend vkei glamour\, humor\, and a wide m
 usical range spanning power-pop\, EDM\, and heavy rock sounds.\nFormed in 
 2016\, Vivarush continues to bring excitement to fans in Japan and around 
 the world. As they celebrate their 10th anniversary in 2026\, Ruimaru\, Yu
 kimura\, Toya\, and Pamy aim to carry Vivarush’s legacy forward.\nTicket
 s from $55\nONLY 50 VIP TICKETS!\nhttps://tdmusichall.mhrth.com/tickets/jm
 fest/\nhttps://jmfest.com
LOCATION:TD Music Hall
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/jmfest-ka-2026-featuring-vivarush-toront
 o/
