 es Fest – Founders Night"\, taking place October 3/26 at the El Mocambo 
 (Under the Neon Palms).\nThis event marks the launch of a NEW independent 
 community initiative to build a Toronto-based Blues festival for 2027\, sh
 owcasing top local talent including Little Magic Sam\, Jay Blues Trio\, an
 d Camilo Restrepo... and some surprise performers.\nThe goal is to bring n
 ew audiences into the city’s blues scene and highlight the strength of h
 omegrown artists. For lovers of The Blues\, or even for live music in gene
 ral\, this night is for music lovers!\nEvent details and tickets: https://
 elmocambo.com/event/toronto-blues-fest-founders-night/ (or https://www.tor
